id: og_scaffold
name: Scaffold
description: Scaffold. Three poured slabs, a finished core and no walls anywhere else, so every floor above the first is a place with nothing at all to stand behind. Built as an office block, most of the way up; the site was abandoned between the frame going up and the cladding going on.

